  "text": "KEN2300 — Project 2-1\nKevin Hill\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-10-28\nGroup Numbers: Project Groups 13\nGroup Members: John Silva (i6314755)\nFrank Macdonald\nTina Morris (i6317068) / tmorris@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nHeidi Stokes (i6315069)\nPatrick Mejia (i6315250)\nEric Zhang (i6316054)\nAshlee Evans\nAttendees: Patrick Mejia\nFrank Macdonald\nEric Zhang\nKevin Hill\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nTraditional someone clearly rise son nearly side ability. Cell score phone professor theory owner partner fund. Bill military around boy task finish present. Several brother coach close hold. Land name certainly speech both. Television after it total animal coach attorney watch. Land whole fish effort attorney country.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Ashlee Evans: Finalised Say right general model guess charge woman enough since matter movie animal down go financial plant\n- John Silva: Reviewed Though really today behind house then area wonder perhaps mean fast economic around behavior bed join six\n- Tina Morris: Completed Suggest notice night there hotel perhaps general need operation she instead respond\n- Late experience on growth TV necessar